Ported from commit 721400f9560831be2fc9790be9b72c44bee7d33f: the 4D Perlin, SuperSimplex,
Value, White and Cellular generators, their hashing and gradient functions, and the FBm and
Ridged fractal combiners (in Engine/Nodes/Generator/NoiseCore.h). The split integer-cell
coordinate, the cellular distance-to-edge and smooth F1 outputs, the Manhattan and Chebyshev
